{"id":"de-witze-1r0tsei.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1r0tsei","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; the narrated 'asks her the same question' is the child repeating his question in the kitchen. Three scenes: father, mother, back to father.","title":"Adam and Eve or Charles Darwin?","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","vovochka-drug"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","vovochka-drug":"child"},"lines":[{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"How did people come to be?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Adam and Eve had children.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Then their children grew up and had children of their own, and so on.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"How did people come to be?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"We used to be apes, then we evolved into what we are today.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"You lied to me!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"No, your mother was only talking about her side of the family.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","vovochka-drug"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","vovochka-drug":"child"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"kukhnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["vovochka-drug","zhena"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","zhena":"mother"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["glasses"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"table"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-left"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","vovochka-drug"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","vovochka-drug":"child"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mmketw.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1mmketw","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Original wording kept; the young applicant is paren, he hands his papers to the boss. Arschloch softened to Blödmann in text.","title":"Das Bewerbungsgespräch","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein junger Mann kommt zum Bewerbungsgespräch, der Chef stellt sich vor.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Wie heißen Sie?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"P-P-P-Peter Müller.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ach, Sie stottern?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"Nein, aber mein Vater und der Standesbeamte war ein Blödmann!","uncensored":"Nein, aber mein Vater und der Standesbeamte war ein Arschloch!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"certificate","action":"give","to":"nachalnik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mmketw.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1mmketw","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; the name stays Peter Müller as in the source, the elliptical 'my father did' kept as «мой отец — да». Мудак softened to козёл in text.","title":"Собеседование","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Молодой человек приходит на собеседование, начальник представляется.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Как вас зовут?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"П-П-П-Петер Мюллер.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"А, вы заикаетесь?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"Нет, но мой отец — да, а работник загса был козёл!","uncensored":"Нет, но мой отец — да, а работник загса был мудак!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"certificate","action":"give","to":"nachalnik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mmketw.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1mmketw","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; Müller becomes Miller, the elliptical answer becomes 'my father did'. Asshole softened to jerk in text.","title":"The Job Interview","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A young man comes in for a job interview, and the boss introduces himself.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"What's your name?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"P-P-P-Peter Miller.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Oh, you stutter?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"No, but my father did, and the registrar was a jerk!","uncensored":"No, but my father did, and the registrar was an asshole!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","paren"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"boss","paren":"employee"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"certificate","action":"give","to":"nachalnik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rtgw9r.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rtgw9r","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Every line kept; the long thinking is a narrator line plus two pauses, the passer-by walks in and walks on. The basket that makes the answer true is requested from the art team.","title":"Die Notlandung","location":"derevnya","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Zwei Ballonflieger müssen notlanden.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Wo sind wir hier?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann überlegt sehr lange.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"In einem Korb.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Das war garantiert ein Psychologe!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Wie kommst du darauf?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Ist doch klar.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Erstens dauerte es eine Ewigkeit, bis er antwortet.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Zweitens ist die Antwort völlig richtig und drittens völlig unbrauchbar!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"balloon-basket","description":"a wicker hot-air balloon basket with the deflated balloon behind it, the two balloonists standing inside","why":"the answer 'in a basket' must be visibly, uselessly true"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"farm","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"looks":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]},"doktor":{"add":["beard"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"map","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rtgw9r.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rtgw9r","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation of every line; the long thinking is a narrator line plus two pauses. The basket is requested from the art team.","title":"Вынужденная посадка","location":"derevnya","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Два воздухоплавателя вынуждены совершить аварийную посадку.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Где мы находимся?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Прохожий очень долго думает.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"В корзине.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Это точно был психолог!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"С чего ты взял?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Это же ясно.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Во-первых, прошла целая вечность, пока он ответил.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Во-вторых, ответ абсолютно правильный, а в-третьих, абсолютно бесполезный!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"balloon-basket","description":"a wicker hot-air balloon basket with the deflated balloon behind it, the two balloonists standing inside","why":"the answer 'in a basket' must be visibly, uselessly true"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"farm","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"looks":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]},"doktor":{"add":["beard"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"map","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rtgw9r.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rtgw9r","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation of every line; the long thinking is a narrator line plus two pauses. The basket is requested from the art team.","title":"The Emergency Landing","location":"derevnya","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Two balloonists have to make an emergency landing.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Where are we?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man thinks for a very long time.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"doktor","text":"In a basket.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"That was definitely a psychologist!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"What makes you say that?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"It's obvious.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"First, it took him forever to answer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Second, the answer is completely correct, and third, completely useless!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"balloon-basket","description":"a wicker hot-air balloon basket with the deflated balloon behind it, the two balloonists standing inside","why":"the answer 'in a basket' must be visibly, uselessly true"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"farm","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","doktor"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot","doktor":"therapist"},"looks":{"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]},"doktor":{"add":["beard"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"map","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"off-right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mp0cqs.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1mp0cqs","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"First-person story turned into a scene; the wife calls from upstairs as an off-screen voice, so her doll stays a surprise until 'Und jetzt?'.","title":"Die Voodoo-Puppe","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"Hast du manchmal stechende Schmerzen im ganzen Körper, als hätte jemand eine Voodoo-Puppe von dir und würde sie mit Nadeln stechen?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Nein.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"zhena","text":"Und jetzt?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mp0cqs.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1mp0cqs","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; the wife calls from upstairs as an off-screen voice.","title":"Кукла вуду","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"У тебя бывают иногда колющие боли по всему телу, как будто у кого-то есть твоя кукла вуду и он колет её иголками?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Нет.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"zhena","text":"А теперь?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1mp0cqs.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1mp0cqs","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; the wife calls from upstairs as an off-screen voice.","title":"The Voodoo Doll","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"Do you ever get stabbing pains all over your body, as if someone had a voodoo doll of you and was sticking needles into it?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4,"offscreen":true},{"character":"muzhik","text":"No.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"zhena","text":"And now?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"offscreen":true,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1syt1a1.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1syt1a1","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Original wording kept (typo 'im 10 Millionen' fixed, number in words); he bursts in at the door with the ticket, her three questions are three lines.","title":"Der Lottogewinn","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Typ gewinnt zehn Millionen im Lotto.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Pack die Koffer, Schatz!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich habe im Lotto gewonnen!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Oh Gott, wie toll!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Und was soll ich einpacken?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Sommerklamotten für die Karibik?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Skisachen für die Alpen?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Völlig egal! Hauptsache, du bist bis heute Abend um acht aus dem Haus!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"sofa"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"ticket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1syt1a1.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1syt1a1","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; he bursts in at the door with the ticket, her three questions are three lines.","title":"Выигрыш в лотерею","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик выигрывает в лотерею десять миллионов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Собирай чемоданы, дорогая!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Я выиграл в лотерею!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"О боже, как здорово!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"А что мне брать с собой?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Летние вещи для Карибов?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Лыжное для Альп?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Без разницы! Главное, чтобы к восьми вечера тебя уже не было дома!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"sofa"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"ticket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1syt1a1.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1syt1a1","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; he bursts in at the door with the ticket, her three questions are three lines.","title":"The Lottery Win","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A guy wins ten million in the lottery.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Pack your bags, honey!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I won the lottery!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Oh my God, how wonderful!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"So what should I pack?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Summer clothes for the Caribbean?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ski gear for the Alps?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Doesn't matter! Just make sure you're out of the house by eight tonight!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"sofa"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"ticket","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1shiiia.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1shiiia","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Original wording kept (3 zu 2 in words); the owner and his dog sit at the bench, the passer-by walks up and stops. The chessboard is requested from the art team.","title":"Hund im Park","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann geht im Park spazieren und sieht einen anderen Mann, der mit seinem Hund Schach spielt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wahnsinn! Das muss der klügste Hund der Welt sein!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Ach was, so schlau ist er gar nicht.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Ich führe drei zu zwei.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"chessboard","description":"a chessboard with pieces on the park bench between the man and his dog","why":"the dog must visibly be playing chess"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"bench"},{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1shiiia.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1shiiia","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; собака → пёс to match the male dog puppet. The chessboard is requested from the art team.","title":"Пёс в парке","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужчина гуляет в парке и видит другого мужчину, который играет в шахматы со своим псом.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Обалдеть! Это, наверное, самый умный пёс на свете!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Да ну, не такой уж он и умный.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Я веду три — два.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"chessboard","description":"a chessboard with pieces on the park bench between the man and his dog","why":"the dog must visibly be playing chess"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"bench"},{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1shiiia.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1shiiia","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation. The chessboard is requested from the art team.","title":"The Dog in the Park","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man is walking in the park and sees another man playing chess with his dog.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wow! That must be the smartest dog in the world!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Nah, he's not that smart.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"I'm leading three to two.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"chessboard","description":"a chessboard with pieces on the park bench between the man and his dog","why":"the dog must visibly be playing chess"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","place":"park","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","pyos"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"everyman","pyos":"dog"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"bench"},{"type":"move","who":"pyos","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1wcyyma.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1wcyyma","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Original wording kept; the cyclist with his old bicycle in front, the tram driver yelling. The tram on rails is requested from the art team.","title":"Radfahrer","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Radfahrer fährt ganz gemütlich Schlangenlinien genau vor der Straßenbahn.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Du hirnloser Depp, du!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Kannst denn nicht woanders fahren?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"Ich schon!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"tram","description":"a street with a tram on rails and its driver's cab window","why":"the punchline works only because the tram cannot leave its rails"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bicycle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1wcyyma.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1wcyyma","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; «Я-то могу!» carries the contrast of 'Ich schon!'. The tram on rails is requested from the art team.","title":"Велосипедист","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Велосипедист не спеша катит зигзагами прямо перед трамваем.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ах ты безмозглый болван!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ты что, не можешь ехать где-нибудь в другом месте?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"Я-то могу!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"tram","description":"a street with a tram on rails and its driver's cab window","why":"the punchline works only because the tram cannot leave its rails"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bicycle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1wcyyma.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1wcyyma","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Literal translation; 'Well, I can!' carries the contrast of 'Ich schon!'. The tram on rails is requested from the art team.","title":"The Cyclist","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A cyclist is leisurely weaving from side to side right in front of a tram.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"You brainless idiot, you!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Can't you ride somewhere else?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"paren","text":"Well, I can!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"needs":[{"kind":"backdrop","id":"tram","description":"a street with a tram on rails and its driver's cab window","why":"the punchline works only because the tram cannot leave its rails"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"paren":"everyman","muzhik-ryzhy":"driver"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bicycle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]}]}
